---
---
<footer id="footer" class="bg-[#0C0902] border-t border-[rgba(237,229,216,0.05)]">
  <div class="max-w-[1320px] mx-auto px-6 md:px-10">

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-[2fr_1fr_1fr_1fr] gap-12 py-16">

      <div>
        <a href="#" class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-5 group w-fit">
          <div class="w-7 h-7 bg-[#E8520A] flex items-center justify-center shrink-0">
            <svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#100D08" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round">
              <circle cx="5" cy="17" r="3"/><circle cx="19" cy="17" r="3"/>
              <path d="M5 14l3-7h8l3 7"/><path d="M8 7l2-4h4l2 4"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <span class="font-display text-[1.4rem] tracking-wide text-[#EDE5D8]">MOTOR STORE</span>
        </a>
        <p class="text-[0.85rem] leading-[1.7] text-[rgba(237,229,216,0.35)] max-w-[260px] mb-6">
          Taller mecánico y tienda de repuestos en Manizales. Más de 15 años con los moteros de Colombia.
        </p>
        <div class="flex gap-2">
          {[
            { label:'Instagram', href:'https://instagram.com/', icon:`<rect x="2" y="2" width="20" height="20" rx="5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"/><path d="M16 11.37A4 4 0 1 1 12.63 8 4 4 0 0 1 16 11.37z" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"/><line x1="17.5" y1="6.5" x2="17.51" y2="6.5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"/>` },
            { label:'Facebook',  href:'https://facebook.com/', icon:`<path d="M18 2h-3a5 5 0 0 0-5 5v3H7v4h3v8h4v-8h3l1-4h-4V7a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h3z" fill="currentColor"/>` },
            { label:'TikTok',    href:'https://tiktok.com/',   icon:`<path d="M19.59 6.69a4.83 4.83 0 0 1-3.77-4.25V2h-3.45v13.67a2.89 2.89 0 0 1-5.77-.39 2.89 2.89 0 0 1 2.89-2.89c.28 0 .54.04.79.1V9.01A6.34 6.34 0 0 0 3.15 15.3a6.34 6.34 0 0 0 12.68 0V9.01a8.16 8.16 0 0 0 4.78 1.52V7.1a4.85 4.85 0 0 1-1.02-.41z" fill="currentColor"/>` },
          ].map(s => (
            <a href={s.href} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label={s.label}
               class="w-9 h-9 border border-[rgba(237,229,216,0.08)] flex items-center justify-center text-[rgba(237,229,216,0.35)] hover:border-[rgba(232,82,10,0.4)] hover:text-[#E8520A] hover:-translate-y-0.5 transition-all">
              <svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" set:html={s.icon} />
            </a>
          ))}
        </div>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h4 class="text-[0.62rem] font-bold tracking-[0.14em] uppercase text-[rgba(237,229,216,0.25)] mb-5">Repuestos</h4>
        <ul class="flex flex-col gap-2.5">
          {['Motor & Transmisión','Frenos & Suspensión','Sistema Eléctrico','Carrocería & Plásticos','Filtros & Lubricantes','Accesorios'].map(i => (
            <li><a href="#catalogo" class="text-[0.85rem] text-[rgba(237,229,216,0.4)] hover:text-[#EDE5D8] hover:pl-1 transition-all">{i}</a></li>
          ))}
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h4 class="text-[0.62rem] font-bold tracking-[0.14em] uppercase text-[rgba(237,229,216,0.25)] mb-5">Servicios</h4>
        <ul class="flex flex-col gap-2.5">
          {['Mantenimiento','Diagnóstico electrónico','Reparación de motor','Sistema de frenos','Rev. técnico-mecánica','Tuning'].map(i => (
            <li><a href="#servicios" class="text-[0.85rem] text-[rgba(237,229,216,0.4)] hover:text-[#EDE5D8] hover:pl-1 transition-all">{i}</a></li>
          ))}
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h4 class="text-[0.62rem] font-bold tracking-[0.14em] uppercase text-[rgba(237,229,216,0.25)] mb-5">Empresa</h4>
        <ul class="flex flex-col gap-2.5">
          {[['Sobre nosotros','#'],['Garantías','#'],['FAQ','#faq'],['Contacto','#contacto']].map(([l,h]) => (
            <li><a href={h} class="text-[0.85rem] text-[rgba(237,229,216,0.4)] hover:text-[#EDE5D8] hover:pl-1 transition-all">{l}</a></li>
          ))}
        </ul>
        <div class="mt-7 pt-5 border-t border-[rgba(237,229,216,0.05)]">
          <p class="text-[0.62rem] tracking-widest uppercase text-[rgba(237,229,216,0.2)] mb-2">Ubicación</p>
          <p class="text-[0.8rem] text-[rgba(237,229,216,0.4)] leading-relaxed">Manizales, Caldas<br>Lun–Sáb: 8am – 6pm</p>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>

    <div class="border-t border-[rgba(237,229,216,0.05)] py-5 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-4 flex-wrap">
      <p class="text-[0.7rem] text-[rgba(237,229,216,0.2)]">© 2025 Motor Store · Todos los derechos reservados.</p>
      <div class="flex gap-5">
        {['Política de privacidad','Términos','Devoluciones'].map(l => (
          <a href="#" class="text-[0.7rem] text-[rgba(237,229,216,0.2)] hover:text-[rgba(237,229,216,0.5)] transition-colors">{l}</a>
        ))}
      </div>
      <span class="text-[0.68rem] text-[rgba(237,229,216,0.15)]">Hecho con <span class="text-[#E8520A]">♥</span> en Manizales</span>
    </div>

  </div>
</footer>
